<p><b>This article contains links to the BioWare Social Network (BSN), which is now closed.</b></p>
<p>These links should be replaced with working links where possible, and tutorials edited to remove reliance on BSN.</p>
</div>
<p>Chargenmorphcfg.xml is the configuration file for the in-game character creator. It dictates what head <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Morph" title="Morph">morph</a> presets (<a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/MOP" title="MOP (page does not exist)">MOP</a>), hairstyles, beards, tattoos, makeup and colour tints (for skin, hair, etc.) are available as selectable options. It is located in &lt;install directory&gt;\packages\core\data\misc.erf
</p>
